  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 14th level, your mastery over blood magic transcends the mere physical. You ignore Immunity to the Lacerated condition and the blood requirement (both for the target creature and for material components) for class features and spells.</p><p>Additionally, any Lacerated condition caused by your spells cannot be removed by healing and heals you for half the damage dealt.</p>",
